{"id":"perfectamente","lemma":"perfectamente","pos":"adv","rank":1189,"glosses":["perfectly"],"ipa":"/peɾˌfeɡtaˈmente/","examples":[{"text":"Todo es perfectamente legal.","en":"It's all perfectly legal.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/552179"},{"text":"El cuenco era perfectamente redondo.","en":"The bowl was perfectly round.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/642274"},{"text":"Esa palabra lo describe perfectamente.","en":"That word describes it perfectly.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/1152194"},{"text":"Sabes perfectamente lo que quiero decir.","en":"You know very well what I mean.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/435692"},{"text":"No grites así, te escucho perfectamente.","en":"Don't shout like that. I can hear you perfectly.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/1195668"}]}